# Finder double-click default apps (role: all).
# macconfig-check.sh compares each row with `duti -x`; handlers.sh and `macconfig-check.sh --fix`
# apply drift with `duti -s <bundle-id> .<ext> all`.
# Format (pipe-delimited): extension | app | bundle-id [| flag]
#   extension: no leading dot (txt, not .txt). A leading dot is accepted and stripped.
#   app:       display name, for reading this file. duti is called with the bundle-id.
#   bundle-id: Launch Services bundle id. Cursor here is the stable `cursor` cask,
#              not Cursor Nightly (co.anysphere.cursor.nightly).
#   flag:      optional.
#              unpinnable — no declared UTI. duti -s returns error -50 (paramErr)
#                on the dynamic UTI, so the handler cannot be set. macconfig-check.sh prints
#                info, not DRIFT, and --fix does not call duti.
#              uti:a,b — also set these UTIs with role all. .plist's preferred type
#                is com.apple.xml-property-list, but duti -x plist follows
#                com.apple.property-list, so both are set.
# html, htm, and xhtml are not listed. They are public.html / public.xhtml, and
# setting that UTI switches the default web browser (http, https, and
# com.apple.default-app.web-browser). The fixer refuses those extensions, those
# UTIs, and any URL scheme even if a row is added back. URL schemes live in
# lib/url-handlers.list (`duti -s <bundle> <scheme>`, no role; role all is error -50).
# Setting an extension sets that extension's UTI. Two extensions that share a UTI
# follow the same app; every such pair in this list wants the same app.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.

# CotEditor
txt|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
text|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
md|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
markdown|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
sh|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
bash|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
zsh|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
fish|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
conf|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
cfg|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor|unpinnable
ini|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
env|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor|unpinnable
toml|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
yaml|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
yml|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
list|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor|unpinnable
log|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
csv|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
json|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
xml|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor
plist|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor|uti:com.apple.property-list,com.apple.xml-property-list
css|CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor

# Cursor (stable cask)
js|Cursor|com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92
swift|Cursor|com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92
